**Job Description**

Sr Manager of Platform Development, partners with technical product management and other key business stakeholders to lead the technology direction, facilitate key technical decision points, and deliver products. The position aligns technology to business strategy and proactively drives a technical direction throughout the organization. The Sr Manager will oversee a platform engineering team(s) building on our Learning Management Platform and related shared services where our full-time students go to school every day.

**ESSENTIAL FUNCTIONS:** Reasonable accommodations may be made to enable individuals with disabilities to perform the essential duties.

* Partner with technical product management and other key business stakeholders to lead the technology direction, facilitate key technical decision points, and deliver products;
* Interface with other engineering groups and enterprise architecture; collaborate on integration projects, best practices, and the introduction of new technologies;
* Commit to roadmaps with capabilities and timelines, with a proven track record for new product and technology evaluation and introduction;
* Align technology to business strategy, and proactively drive a technical direction throughout the organization;
* Adopt a Continuous Integration/Deployment (CI/CD) methodology and institute a frequent release cadence;
* Manage a team consisting of Software Engineers and Quality Assurance Engineers. Oversee both fulltime and contract resources;
* Lead and mentor engineering team members;
* Have an innovation mindset to product development, engineering, and development processes and provide thought leadership and information dissemination in this area.

